{"seq":47,"slug":"domain-driven-design","title":"领域驱动设计","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 领域驱动设计\n\n软件最难的部分从来不是写代码，而是搞清楚要解决的究竟是什么问题。一个保险理赔系统、一个电商订单引擎、一套医院排班软件，它们的复杂性都不在语法层面，而在于业务规则盘根错节、术语含义随部门漂移、需求随市场不断变形。领域驱动设计（Domain-Driven Design，DDD）由 Eric Evans 在 2003 年的同名著作中系统提出，它给出的核心主张只有一句：把软件的结构对齐到业务领域本身，让代码成为领域知识的精确表达，而不是数据库表的搬运工。\n\n这个 hub 按照「先理解、再切分、再建模、再落地」的认知顺序，分四章层层递进。\n\n第一章「基础」回答「DDD 是什么、为什么值得」。它讲清模型驱动设计的价值，确立贯穿全书的通用语言这一根基，并先勾勒出战略设计与战术设计这两个层次的分工——后面三章正是对这张地图的逐块填充。\n\n第二章「战略设计」处理「大尺度的切分」。当系统大到一个模型无法覆盖整个业务时，必须把它拆成多个限界上下文，用上下文映射厘清这些上下文之间的协作关系，并通过子域划分识别出哪里是值得重金投入的核心、哪里只需采购现成方案。这一章决定的是边界，是架构层面最贵也最难逆转的决策。\n\n第三章「战术设计」处理「单个上下文内部的建模」。在一个边界清晰的上下文里，如何用实体与值对象刻画领域对象，如何用聚合守护业务不变量与一致性边界，如何用领域事件与领域服务表达那些不属于任何单一对象的行为。这是把领域知识真正编码进类型系统的地方。\n\n第四章「落地实践」处理「如何让这套模型在工程上活下来」。它讲分层架构与六边形架构如何把领域模型与技术细节隔离，讲仓储与工厂如何在不污染模型的前提下管理对象的持久化与构造，最后讲 DDD 与微服务这对在 2026 年已成主流的搭档——限界上下文如何自然地成为服务边界。\n\n四章之间是一条单向递进的链：理解领域，才能正确切分；切对了边界，战术建模才有意义；模型立住了，落地才不会走样。建议按顺序读，但每篇都做了交叉链接，便于随时回看上游概念。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ddd-overview","title":"DDD 概念与价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/foundations/ddd-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ubiquitous-language","title":"通用语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/foundations/ubiquitous-language"},{"seq":3,"slug":"strategic-vs-tactical","title":"战略与战术设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/foundations/strategic-vs-tactical"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategic","title":"战略设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/strategic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bounded-contexts","title":"限界上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/strategic/bounded-contexts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"context-mapping","title":"上下文映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/strategic/context-mapping"},{"seq":3,"slug":"subdomains","title":"子域划分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/strategic/subdomains"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tactical","title":"战术设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/tactical","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"entities-value-objects","title":"实体与值对象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/tactical/entities-value-objects"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aggregates","title":"聚合与聚合根","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/tactical/aggregates"},{"seq":3,"slug":"domain-events-services","title":"领域事件与服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/tactical/domain-events-services"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"implementation","title":"落地实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"layered-hexagonal","title":"分层与六边形架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/implementation/layered-hexagonal"},{"seq":2,"slug":"repositories-factories","title":"仓储与工厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/implementation/repositories-factories"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ddd-microservices","title":"DDD 与微服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/domain-driven-design/implementation/ddd-microservices"}]}]}